	<p><font face="verdana, arial, helvetica" size="2" class="nf">Nice work, ksmith.  You should take a look around the web for "Convex Hull" algorithms for doing your line detections.  Since some of your regions have concavity, you will have to modify the algorithms somewhat, but they might give you a decent head start.  <br />
